<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <body style="font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px; color: #1a1a1a;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 16px;">Welcome to The Growth Project</h1>
    <p>Hi{{#if client_name}} {{client_name}}{{/if}},</p>
    <p>You're all set up{{#if coach_name}} with {{coach_name}} as your coach{{/if}}. The first 7 days are about getting one daily check-in in — that's where every habit starts.</p>
    <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
      <a href="{{app_url}}" style="display: inline-block; background: #4f46e5; color: #fff; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">Open The Growth Project</a>
    </p>
    <h3 style="margin-top: 28px; font-size: 16px;">What to do today</h3>
    <ul style="line-height: 1.6;">
      <li>Log your first check-in</li>
      <li>Set your starting weight (so we can show your trend)</li>
      <li>Say hi to your coach in the chat tab</li>
    </ul>
    <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eaeaea; margin: 32px 0;" />
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #888;">Questions? Reply here — we read every message.</p>
  </body>
</html>
